   "date": "2022-11-10",
   "text": "Disaster and Emergency Pricing Abuse Prevention Act\n This bill makes it unlawful to sell, or offer for sale, an essential good or service at an unconscionably excessive price during, or in anticipation of, a natural disaster, pandemic, or state of emergency."
